{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-100",
  "title": "Email Marketing Strategy",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Email Marketing Strategy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You could apply the water quality database strategy to public access TV by leveraging community data and audience engagement to collect emails and drive participation. Here’s how:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Identify a Valuable Data Asset**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Public access stations already house rich archives of local content, including:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Program schedules & upcoming events**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Producer directories** (local creators and their work)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Community bulletins** (news, city updates, etc.)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Viewer analytics** (if available)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Closed captioning/transcription data** (for accessibility)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Many cities also have **public datasets** (crime rates, housing reports, school rankings, etc.) that could be repurposed into interactive tools."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Repackage It as a Useful Tool**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Instead of just listing showtimes, create an interactive tool where users **enter their zip code or interests** and get a **personalized report** on:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **What’s on TV in their area** (with reminders)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Local events & community initiatives**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Hyperlocal content creators & shows they might like**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Civic updates (city council meetings, public hearings, etc.)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Opportunities to participate in local media (open studio time, classes, etc.)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Capture Emails Through a Value Exchange**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Require users to **enter their email** to receive:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A **weekly digest** of shows/events relevant to them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Personalized **reminders** for upcoming programs they care about."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Early access to **new content** from local creators."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Free access to **local workshops or screenings**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Leverage It for Engagement & Monetization**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Boost participation**: Let users \"follow\" specific shows or producers, increasing engagement."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Drive membership**: Offer premium access to extra content, behind-the-scenes features, or voting on local programming."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Attract sponsors**: With an engaged email list, stations can show sponsors their active community reach."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Example Execution on Docket.tv**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**A \"What’s on in Your Neighborhood?\" tool**: Users enter their zip code and get a list of community-driven shows, city updates, and upcoming public events."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**A \"Find Your Show\" quiz**: Like Netflix recommendations, but for public access content."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**\"Never Miss an Episode\" alerts**: Users subscribe to reminders for their favorite shows."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**\"Be on TV\" sign-up**: Users get notifications about open studio slots, calls for content, or local media classes."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This method makes public access TV **more interactive and personalized**, while growing an **engaged audience** that stations can monetize through sponsorships, memberships, and events."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}